<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>배송 상세</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: sans-serif; padding: 20px; }
        h1 { margin-bottom: 4px; }
        a { text-decoration: none; color: #007bff; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
        .info-box { background: #f8f9fa; border: 1px solid #dee2e6; border-radius: 6px;
                    padding: 14px 18px; margin-bottom: 20px; display: flex; gap: 32px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
        .info-box span { font-size: 0.95em; color: #495057; }
        .info-box strong { color: #212529; }
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
        th, td { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px; text-align: left; }
        th { background-color: #f2f2f2; }
        tr:nth-child(even) { background-color: #f9f9f9; }
        .status-badge { padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 0.85em; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block; }
        .status-SHIPPED   { background: #f0d9ff; color: #4a0072; }
        .status-DELIVERED { background: #d1e7dd; color: #0a3622; }
        .status-ASSIGNED  { background: #cfe2ff; color: #084298; }
        .status-APPROVED  { background: #d1e7dd; color: #0a3622; }
        .status-PICKING   { background: #fff3cd; color: #664d03; }
        .status-PACKING   { background: #fff3cd; color: #664d03; }
        .btn-success { padding: 8px 20px; background-color: #28a745; color: white;
                       border: none; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.95em; margin-top: 16px; }
        .error { color: red; margin: 8px 0; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<a href="/delivery">← 배송 목록으로</a>

<h1>배송 상세</h1>

{{#errorMessage}}
    <p class="error">{{errorMessage}}</p>
{{/errorMessage}}

<div class="info-box">
    <span><strong>출발 창고</strong>: {{outbound.warehouse.name}}</span>
    <span><strong>배송 지점</strong>: {{outbound.store.name}} ({{outbound.store.address}})</span>
    <span><strong>발주 요청 시간</strong>: {{outbound.stockOrder.requestTime}}</span>
    <span>
        <strong>배송 상태</strong>:
        <span class="status-badge status-{{outbound.status}}">{{outbound.status.description}}</span>
    </span>
</div>

<table>
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th>품목명 (SKU)</th>
            <th>수량</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        {{#details}}
        <tr>
            <td>{{skuName}}</td>
            <td>{{quantity}}</td>
        </tr>
        {{/details}}
        {{^details}}
        <tr>
            <td colspan="2" style="text-align: center;">상세 내역이 없습니다.</td>
        </tr>
        {{/details}}
    </tbody>
</table>

{{#canDeliver}}
<form action="/delivery/{{outboundId}}/complete" method="post">
    <button type="submit" class="btn-success"
            onclick="return confirm('상품을 모두 수령하셨습니까? 배송 완료로 처리됩니다.')">수령 완료 처리</button>
</form>
{{/canDeliver}}

</body>
</html>
